{"id":"u08","level":"A1","emoji":"🛍️","title":{"t":"Shopping and colors","s":"خرید و رنگ‌ها","a":"audio/en-fa/93c9e99bbdb8.mp3"},"goals":["می‌توانم لباس‌ها و رنگ‌ها را نام ببرم.","می‌توانم قیمت چیزی را بپرسم.","می‌توانم با this / that / these / those به چیزها اشاره کنم."],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"shirt","pl":"shirts","s":"پیراهن (مردانه)","pr":"شِرت","emoji":"👔","ex":{"t":"This shirt is blue.","s":"این پیراهن آبی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/77d25fa6bc23.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f454.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/c748f7561cde.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/aa495da733bd.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"T-shirt","pl":"T-shirts","s":"تی‌شرت","pr":"تی‌شِرت","emoji":"👕","ex":{"t":"I'd like a white T-shirt, please.","s":"یک تی‌شرت سفید می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/99b13d992dd7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f455.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/29aa6083a7e8.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/747aadf1e2ae.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"pants","s":"شلوار","pr":"پَنتس","emoji":"👖","ex":{"t":"These pants are black.","s":"این شلوار مشکی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/625de81e9aa3.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f456.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/8580e565966b.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"dress","pl":"dresses","s":"پیراهن زنانه، لباس زنانه","pr":"دْرِس","emoji":"👗","ex":{"t":"Maryam's dress is red.","s":"لباس مریم قرمز است.","a":"audio/en-fa/1bd663bcd8fc.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f457.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/a3a576b0634a.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/dc38b8277bbb.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"shoe","pl":"shoes","s":"کفش","pr":"شو","emoji":"👞","ex":{"t":"I like these shoes.","s":"من این کفش‌ها را دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/84341d19ba5e.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f45e.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/774a6b5d4959.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/d362121654a3.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"coat","pl":"coats","s":"کت، پالتو","pr":"کُوت","emoji":"🧥","ex":{"t":"My coat is black.","s":"کت من مشکی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/575c074ab722.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9e5.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/c194cd8d1635.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/42f4da688e37.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"scarf","pl":"scarves","s":"شال‌گردن","pr":"سْکارف","emoji":"🧣","ex":{"t":"My grandmother has a green scarf.","s":"مادربزرگم یک شال‌گردن سبز دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/6d98aa6f6e91.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9e3.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/d3ae89956676.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/c328811fbde2.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"bag","pl":"bags","s":"کیف","pr":"بَگ","emoji":"👜","ex":{"t":"Is this your bag?","s":"این کیف توست؟","a":"audio/en-fa/8fa777c887af.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f45c.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/7974ef920e0c.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/773528b63cb1.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"red","s":"قرمز","pr":"رِد","emoji":"🔴","ex":{"t":"The apple is red.","s":"سیب قرمز است.","a":"audio/en-fa/1411015c2c0b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f534.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/177b3355e4d2.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"blue","s":"آبی","pr":"بْلو","emoji":"🔵","ex":{"t":"Ali's shirt is blue.","s":"پیراهن علی آبی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/319b4651caa9.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f535.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/007e3ca1741f.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"green","s":"سبز","pr":"گْرین","emoji":"🟢","ex":{"t":"I'd like the green bag, please.","s":"کیف سبز را می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/015315ebed2b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f7e2.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/446f000e972b.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"black","s":"سیاه، مشکی","pr":"بْلَک","emoji":"⚫","ex":{"t":"I like black tea.","s":"من چای سیاه دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/6af2e6aba9a6.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26ab.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/188a925095e2.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"white","s":"سفید","pr":"وایت","emoji":"⚪","ex":{"t":"Milk is white.","s":"شیر سفید است.","a":"audio/en-fa/460bea5a1f3f.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26aa.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/178f4bec8ea3.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"yellow","s":"زرد","pr":"یِلُو","emoji":"🟡","ex":{"t":"Bananas are yellow.","s":"موز زرد است.","a":"audio/en-fa/a10bcc93de8f.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f7e1.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/cab275aca731.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"How much is it?","s":"قیمتش چقدر است؟","pr":"هاو ماچ ایز ایت؟","a":"audio/en-fa/b597c5fb57ae.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"How much are they?","s":"قیمتشان چقدر است؟","pr":"هاو ماچ آر ذِی؟","a":"audio/en-fa/e7bc3847f71e.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"It's ten dollars.","s":"ده دلار است.","pr":"ایتس تِن دالِرز","a":"audio/en-fa/7b54b857a38d.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Can I help you?","s":"می‌توانم کمکتان کنم؟","pr":"کَن آی هِلپ یو؟","a":"audio/en-fa/660cd8b782fc.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"I'm just looking.","s":"فقط نگاه می‌کنم.","pr":"آیم جاست لوکینگ","a":"audio/en-fa/9ae00e3389b3.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"What color is it?","s":"چه رنگی است؟","pr":"وات کالِر ایز ایت؟","a":"audio/en-fa/050f901a3c98.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"It's too big.","s":"زیادی بزرگ است.","pr":"ایتس تو بیگ","a":"audio/en-fa/142d83894acc.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","pr":"هیر یو آر","a":"audio/en-fa/7f965ecd5ac9.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"At the clothing store","s":"در مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی","a":"audio/en-fa/10c4e1c3ab66.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Tom","voice":"m"},"B":{"name":"Mina","voice":"f"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hello. Can I help you?","s":"سلام. می‌توانم کمکتان کنم؟","a":"audio/en-fa/64669a734c56.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, please. How much is this scarf?","s":"بله، لطفاً. این شال‌گردن چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/ca8712656ce6.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"The green scarf? It's five dollars.","s":"شال‌گردن سبز؟ پنج دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/cfc7be446a69.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"And that bag?","s":"آن کیف چطور؟","a":"audio/en-fa/0fd5a1ea6bd5.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"The black bag is twenty dollars.","s":"کیف مشکی بیست دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/9c73c9357a3f.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hmm. And how much are those shoes?","s":"هوم. آن کفش‌ها چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/70e24273b3f5.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"These white shoes? They're fifteen dollars.","s":"این کفش‌های سفید؟ پانزده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/3acff8dfe688.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"OK. I'd like the scarf and the shoes, please.","s":"باشه. شال‌گردن و کفش‌ها را می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/9bfedf4d2807.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"That's twenty dollars, please.","s":"می‌شود بیست دلار، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/4233bd4a4db7.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","a":"audio/en-fa/7f965ecd5ac9.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"this / that / these / those","s":"این / آن / این‌ها / آن‌ها"},"explain":"برای چیزی که **نزدیک** ماست، **this** (این) و برای چیزی که **دور** است، **that** (آن) می‌گوییم.\nبرای چند چیز (جمع): **these** (این‌ها) و **those** (آن‌ها).\nبعد از this و that فعل **is** می‌آید: **This shirt is blue.**\nبعد از these و those فعل **are** می‌آید: **These shoes are black.**\nنکته: **pants** (شلوار) در انگلیسی همیشه جمع است: **These pants are black.**","table":[["this shirt","these shirts"],["that shirt","those shirts"]],"examples":[{"t":"This bag is red.","s":"این کیف قرمز است.","a":"audio/en-fa/d5d94b0e7d46.mp3"},{"t":"That coat is black.","s":"آن کت مشکی است.","a":"audio/en-fa/62ca2f7cf159.mp3"},{"t":"These shoes are white.","s":"این کفش‌ها سفید هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/8385a9ab92b4.mp3"},{"t":"Those T-shirts are green.","s":"آن تی‌شرت‌ها سبز هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/df21847f6b0f.mp3"},{"t":"I like these pants.","s":"من این شلوار را دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/d815e741dd47.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"___ shoes are black.","options":["This","These","That"],"answer":1,"s":"این کفش‌ها مشکی هستند.","full":"These shoes are black.","a":"audio/en-fa/a1d9c473c7fe.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ bag is blue.","options":["That","Those","These"],"answer":0,"s":"آن کیف آبی است.","full":"That bag is blue.","a":"audio/en-fa/c5cbf20e642a.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"These shirts ___ white.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":2,"s":"این پیراهن‌ها سفید هستند.","full":"These shirts are white.","a":"audio/en-fa/ca75b1929ed1.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ coat is red.","answer":["This"],"s":"این کت قرمز است.","full":"This coat is red.","a":"audio/en-fa/f66e297f28e4.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ T-shirts are yellow.","answer":["Those"],"s":"آن تی‌شرت‌ها زرد هستند.","full":"Those T-shirts are yellow.","a":"audio/en-fa/8b6fb88511b6.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I like this green scarf.","s":"من این شال‌گردن سبز را دوست دارم.","full":"I like this green scarf.","a":"audio/en-fa/d003f054d090.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Those pants ___ black.","options":["are","is"],"answer":0,"s":"آن شلوار مشکی است.","full":"Those pants are black.","a":"audio/en-fa/235f4aab7725.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"How much is it? / a red dress","s":"پرسیدن قیمت و جای رنگ در جمله"},"explain":"برای پرسیدن قیمت یک چیز می‌گوییم: **How much is it?** یا **How much is this shirt?**\nبرای چیزهای جمع: **How much are they?** یا **How much are these shoes?**\nجواب: **It's ten dollars.** / **They're ten dollars.** (ده دلار است.)\nدر انگلیسی **رنگ قبل از اسم** می‌آید، برعکسِ فارسی: **a red dress** (یک لباس قرمز)، **black shoes** (کفش مشکی).\nرنگ‌ها هیچ‌وقت جمع بسته نمی‌شوند: **red shoes** (نه reds shoes).","table":[["How much is","this bag?"],["How much are","these shoes?"],["a + color + thing","a blue shirt"]],"examples":[{"t":"How much is this T-shirt? It's twelve dollars.","s":"این تی‌شرت چند است؟ دوازده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/bb18619debe9.mp3"},{"t":"How much are these shoes? They're twenty dollars.","s":"این کفش‌ها چند است؟ بیست دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/2e1f73846a37.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like a white shirt, please.","s":"یک پیراهن سفید می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/d4907941e348.mp3"},{"t":"Sara has a green bag.","s":"سارا یک کیف سبز دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/3cd5265b6bc2.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"How much ___ this scarf?","options":["is","are"],"answer":0,"s":"این شال‌گردن چند است؟","full":"How much is this scarf?","a":"audio/en-fa/13681a8c660d.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"How much ___ these pants?","options":["is","are"],"answer":1,"s":"این شلوار چند است؟","full":"How much are these pants?","a":"audio/en-fa/0a32f951d0f0.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"I'd like a ___, please.","options":["bag red","red bag","reds bag"],"answer":1,"s":"یک کیف قرمز می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","full":"I'd like a red bag, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/1af99efb318d.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"How much is this coat?","s":"این کت چند است؟","full":"How much is this coat?","a":"audio/en-fa/f89539d41d9e.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"She has a blue dress.","s":"او یک لباس آبی دارد.","full":"She has a blue dress.","a":"audio/en-fa/9a97d19917d0.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"How ___ is it?","answer":["much"],"s":"قیمتش چقدر است؟","full":"How much is it?","a":"audio/en-fa/b597c5fb57ae.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"It's fifteen ___.","answer":["dollars"],"s":"پانزده دلار است.","full":"It's fifteen dollars.","a":"audio/en-fa/2e7141fc1c90.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"At the clothing store","s":"در مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی","a":"audio/en-fa/10c4e1c3ab66.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Maryam and her daughter Mina are at a clothing store.","s":"مریم و دخترش مینا در یک مغازهٔ لباس‌فروشی هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/6a99800c61a8.mp3"},{"t":"Mina likes red. She would like a red dress.","s":"مینا رنگ قرمز را دوست دارد. او یک لباس قرمز می‌خواهد.","a":"audio/en-fa/2b9e286a53a7.mp3"},{"t":"The red dress is eighteen dollars.","s":"لباس قرمز هجده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/21fc5072e541.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam likes the black coat, but it's too big.","s":"مریم کت مشکی را دوست دارد، اما زیادی بزرگ است.","a":"audio/en-fa/8f65bbf9e0fe.mp3"},{"t":"There are some white T-shirts next to the coats.","s":"کنار کت‌ها چند تی‌شرت سفید هست.","a":"audio/en-fa/ac018bcb58ba.mp3"},{"t":"They are six dollars.","s":"قیمتشان شش دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/aab4d0f7198b.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam would like a white T-shirt for Amir.","s":"مریم یک تی‌شرت سفید برای امیر می‌خواهد.","a":"audio/en-fa/f507abe2b954.mp3"},{"t":"Amir is her son.","s":"امیر پسرِ اوست.","a":"audio/en-fa/af795ecbeb08.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"What color is Mina's dress?","s":"لباس مینا چه رنگی است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/96a5433d3e95.mp3"},"options":["red","black","white"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"How much is the red dress?","s":"لباس قرمز چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/411a7ac20728.mp3"},"options":["eight dollars","eighteen dollars","twenty dollars"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"How much are the white T-shirts?","s":"تی‌شرت‌های سفید چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/299f5254e9b8.mp3"},"options":["sixteen dollars","ten dollars","six dollars"],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Who is Amir?","s":"امیر کیست؟","a":"audio/en-fa/72559d3231d8.mp3"},"options":["Mina's father","Maryam's son","Maryam's brother"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"How much is this bag?","s":"این کیف چند است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/9efb70b88efa.mp3"},{"t":"These shoes are black.","s":"این کفش‌ها مشکی هستند.","a":"audio/en-fa/a1d9c473c7fe.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like a blue T-shirt, please.","s":"یک تی‌شرت آبی می‌خواهم، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/a45209750cf7.mp3"},{"t":"That coat is too big.","s":"آن کت زیادی بزرگ است.","a":"audio/en-fa/b2dc26a1762c.mp3"},{"t":"Those pants are fifteen dollars.","s":"آن شلوار پانزده دلار است.","a":"audio/en-fa/fac48690925e.mp3"},{"t":"My sister has a yellow dress.","s":"خواهرم یک لباس زرد دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/0d0bad41fc40.mp3"},{"t":"What color is your scarf?","s":"شال‌گردنت چه رنگی است؟","a":"audio/en-fa/8d04eea98c1f.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f6cd.svg"}